        <http://example.org/education/concept/Braunkohleabbau>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Erdbau>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Hydraulikbagger>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Industrielle_Revolution>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Maschinentechnik>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/R%C3%BCtteltechnologie>,
