        <http://example.org/education/concept/Multiplikation>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Nat%C3%BCrliche_Zahlen>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Potenzmengen>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Zahlenfolgen>,
