        <http://example.org/education/concept/Lehrerbildung>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Sozialarbeit>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Sozialp%C3%A4dagogik>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Universit%C3%A4tskultur>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Wohlfahrtswissenschaften> ;
