        <http://example.org/education/concept/Elektrowerkzeuge>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Gef%C3%A4hrdungsbeurteilung>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Ger%C3%A4teschutz>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/L%C3%A4rmschutz>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Schlagbohrmaschinen>,
