        <http://example.org/education/concept/Maschinensicherheit>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Mensch-Maschine-Interaktion>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Strahlenschutz>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Verpackungsanlagen>,
