        <http://example.org/education/concept/Intersektionalit%C3%A4t>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Kritische_P%C3%A4dagogik>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Migrationsp%C3%A4dagogik>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/P%C3%A4dagogik>,
