        <http://example.org/education/concept/Explosionsschutz>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Gef%C3%A4hrdungsbeurteilung>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/K%C3%B6rperverletzung>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/L%C3%A4rmschutz>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Muskel-Skelett-Erkrankungen>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Staubbelastung> ;
    dcterms:title "Zentrales Produktbeispiel: Bohrmaschine Risikobeurteilung (Bohrmaschine_Risikobeurteilung)"@de ;
    dcterms:type <http://example.org/education/type/Dokumentation> .

