        <http://example.org/education/concept/Leichtbau>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Reparaturfreundlichkeit>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Schienenfahrzeuge>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Strukturmechanik>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Verkehrstechnik>,
