        <http://example.org/education/concept/Kognitive_Modellierung>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Lehr-Lern-Szenarien>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Multimediales_Lernen>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Psychologie_des_Lehrens_und_Lernens>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Textverstehen> ;
