        <http://example.org/education/concept/E-Learning>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Informatik>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Kollaboratives_Arbeiten>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Kommunikationstechnologie>,
        <http://example.org/education/concept/Lernplattformen>,
